# Code ownership - who reviews what.
#
# SETUP: replace the three placeholders below with the real GitHub handles, e.g.
#   @IO-PLACEHOLDER  ->  @someuser
# Until that is done these entries match nobody and no reviewers are auto-requested.
#
#   IO        - the game API, the state object, the evaluation harness, CI
#   ALGO      - pathfinding
#   STRATEGY  - the behavior tree and the agent's actual behavior
#
# "Owner" means: that person's session is the one that edits the file. If you need a
# change in someone else's file, coordinate first (see CLAUDE.md > Collaboration).

# Fallback - anything not claimed below.
